'''Stanley station''' is a train station in [[Stanley, North Dakota]] served by [[Amtrak]]'s ''[[Empire Builder]]'' line. The platform, tracks, and wooden depot are owned by [[BNSF Railway]]. It was originally a [[Great Northern Railway (U.S.)|Great Northern Railway]] station that was a replacement for an earlier one, which is now a private residence.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.gngoat.org/depots_nd.htm|title=Depots ND|website=www.gngoat.org}}</ref>

